{"html":"<h1 id=\"historical-vkf-webassembly-browser-diagnostic\">Historical VKF WebAssembly browser diagnostic</h1>\n<p>Workload: <code>spectral-norm-small</code>. Three warmups and ten measured runs per cell.</p>\n<p>Environment: GitHub <code>macos15</code> image <code>20260829.0321.1</code>; macOS 15.7.9 (Darwin 24.6.0); arm64 Apple M1 (Virtual). Chrome 152.0.7977.65 with ChromeDriver/WebDriver 152.0.7977.64, Firefox 154.0.1 with geckodriver 0.37.1, and Safari 26.6.1.</p>\n<p>This early run did not capture a same-host native VKF baseline, so it is not presented as a language-performance comparison. The raw JSON retains all diagnostic artifact cells.</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Scrollable table\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">VKF WebAssembly runtime</th><th scope=\"col\">Mean ± sample SD</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Chrome (V8)</td><td>69.880 ± 48.378 ms</td></tr><tr><td>Firefox (SpiderMonkey)</td><td>48.400 ± 8.113 ms</td></tr><tr><td>Safari (JavaScriptCore)</td><td>48.400 ± 4.402 ms</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p>Compile, cold instantiate+execute, warm-kernel <a href=\"../sources/benchmarks/core-comparison/results/macos-arm64-wasm-provisional-10.json\">raw samples and CI95</a> are retained with artifact and compiler hashes. See the <a href=\"https://github.com/svenviktorjonsson/vektor-flow/actions/runs/34196797747\">successful source workflow run</a>. No aggregate score or release-performance claim is made.</p>","headings":[{"level":1,"title":"Historical VKF WebAssembly browser diagnostic","id":"historical-vkf-webassembly-browser-diagnostic"}],"examples":[],"source":"benchmarks/core-comparison/results/macos-arm64-wasm-provisional-10.md","route":"benchmarks/browser-0.4.3.html","releaseCatalog":{"schema":"vektor-flow/release-catalog-v1","latest":"0.4.7","latestBrowserRuntime":{"version":"0.4.7","url":"https://vektorflow.org/runtimes/v0.4.7/vkf-shared-compiler.wasm?sha256=d906c29e80bb4fa6ed3999379ad8679bc55a6ba708a50483fe09147437a1b3e9"},"releases":[{"version":"0.4.7","tag":"v0.4.7","status":"published","browserRuntimeWasm":"https://vektorflow.org/runtimes/v0.4.7/vkf-shared-compiler.wasm?sha256=d906c29e80bb4fa6ed3999379ad8679bc55a6ba708a50483fe09147437a1b3e9","benchmarkTier":"patch","benchmark":{"summary":"Local Windows, Linux, and Firefox comparisons; unmeasured cells remain explicit.","browser":null,"evidenceUrl":"https://vektorflow.org/performance.html"},"downloads":{"windows":{"installer":"https://vektorflow.org/downloads/v0.4.7/vektor-flow-windows-x64-setup.exe?sha256=2f656c5cb9f3d4f8e544a2157c54dce1d73004e7296e842573da1acada27a955","archive":"https://vektorflow.org/downloads/v0.4.7/vektor-flow-windows-x64.zip?sha256=ca05457ebf22f79b4ec2807f486146e33c37fbd83a23059ef647f5de4c8884b4"},"linux":{"installer":"https://vektorflow.org/downloads/v0.4.7/vektor-flow-linux-x64.deb?sha256=2eccd6af9460a50538d7bbf06c09f3a77f695c4bb0f56a2531379bbb8d60bd71","archive":"https://vektorflow.org/downloads/v0.4.7/vektor-flow-linux-x64.tar.gz?sha256=a97acc60fa5630babad4aeafc47dd622c3b54a754d7cb6f5fcc705d0f69f8cf8"},"macos":{"installer":null,"archive":null},"browserWasm":"https://vektorflow.org/downloads/v0.4.7/vektor-flow-browser-wasm.zip?sha256=eee0782a3d5c85dd35d86f78f0e2009c238c7612df826b3802c3f7f5dfc16cfc"}}]},"dependencies":[],"assets":[{"source":"benchmarks/core-comparison/results/macos-arm64-wasm-provisional-10.json","output":"sources/benchmarks/core-comparison/results/macos-arm64-wasm-provisional-10.json"}]}
